<h2>Why I ride</h2>
<p>Cycling brings together movement, adventure, discovery, and a wonderful change of perspective. Some rides are about challenging myself. Others are about enjoying the landscape or catching a small wildlife moment along the way.</p>
<p><strong>Caloosa Riders Bicycle Club</strong> makes it possible to share that joy. Founded in 1988, the club brings together Southwest Florida cyclists with a broad range of abilities and interests through group rides, events, and advocacy for safer cycling.</p>
<h2>Where art meets the road</h2>
<p>My art and cycling worlds are coming together in a new way: a <strong>special-edition Caloosa Riders cycling jersey featuring my original artwork</strong>. The final design remains a surprise, and I’m excited to reveal it when the time comes.</p>
<p>Being part of the community is about more than putting miles on a bike. It is about connecting, supporting each other, and making Southwest Florida a better place to ride.</p>
